2975	3052	2936	2937	The gentlemen	455	“ No . I think after this evening we shall feel at rest , which I am sure I have not done for many weeks ; at least , that kind of rest when the hands have nothing more to do , and all the arrangements are complete for an event which must occupy one ’s head and heart . I shall be glad to have time to think , and I am sure Edith will . ”
