3332	3406	3281	3281	his	135	“ Oh , I have never thought much about it ; only I should like it to be a very fine summer morning ; and I should like to walk to church through the shade of trees ; and not to have so many bridesmaids , and to have no wedding - breakfast . I dare say I am resolving against the very things that have given me the most trouble just now . ”
