48609	48763	48601	48601	her	122	“ Oh , Bessy , I loved the home we have left so dearly ! I wish you could see it . I can not tell you half its beauty . There are great trees standing all about it , with their branches stretching long and level , and making a deep shade of rest even at noonday . And yet , though every leaf may seem still , there is a continual rushing sound of movement all around — not close at hand . Then sometimes the turf is as soft and fine as velvet ; and sometimes quite lush with the perpetual moisture of a little , hidden , tinkling brook near at hand . And then in other parts there are billowy ferns — whole stretches of fern ; some in the green shadow ; some with long streaks of golden sunlight lying on them — just like the sea . ”
48764	48772	48774	48774	Bessy	200	“ I have never seen the sea , ”
48776	48781	48774	48774	Bessy	200	“ But go on . ”
