48983	49094	48774	48774	Bessy	200	“ I used to think once that if I could have a day of doing nothing , to rest me — a day in some quiet place like that yo ’ speak on — it would maybe set me up . But now I ’ve had many days o ’ idleness , and I ’m just as weary ’ o them as I was o ’ my work . Sometimes I ’m so tired out I think I can not enjoy heaven without a piece of rest first . I ’m rather afeard o ’ going straight there without getting a good sleep in the grave to set me up . ”
