184451	184459	185686	185686	MARGARET	122	“ No , none , thank you . ”
184460	184481	185710	185710	ELLIOTT	285	“ Are you building on your own account ? If you are , I ’m very much obliged to you . ”
184482	184500	185686	185686	MARGARET	122	“ I ’m building a dining - room — for the men I mean — the hands . ”
